    Portal -->|HTTPS| Gateway
    Admin -->|HTTPS| Gateway
    Gateway -->|REST / HTTPS| API
    API --> Idempotencia
    Idempotencia --> BDCobranzas
    API --> Aplicacion
    Aplicacion --> Adapter
    Adapter -->|REST / HTTPS + Idempotency-Key| Agregador
    Aplicacion -->|SQL| BDCobranzas
    Aplicacion --> Outbox
    Outbox -->|AMQP / TLS| Bus
    Bus -->|Eventos| Conciliacion
    Bus -->|Eventos| Notificaciones
    Bus -->|Eventos| Reportes
    Gateway -->|OIDC / HTTPS| Identidad
    API -.->|Strangler Fig| Monolito

